  "title": "Chef John's Peach Melba",
  "description": "Peach Melba is a delicious and impressive summer dessert made with fresh peaches poached in vanilla syrup, served with ice cream and raspberry sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
